{
  "uid": "claude-code-semaines",
  "title": "Claude Code — une semaine contre l'autre",
  "tags": [
    "claude",
    "quota",
    "comparaison"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "description": "Compare la semaine de quota en cours à la précédente, À DURÉE ÉCOULÉE ÉGALE : offset 7d décale la même fenêtre de sept jours, donc on compare le même nombre d'heures depuis jeudi. Comparer une semaine partielle à une semaine complète donnerait toujours une baisse.",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3d/w+3d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "1h"
    ],
    "nowDelay": "1m"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "machine",
        "label": "Machine",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "victoriametrics"
        },
        "query": "label_values({__name__=\"claude_code.token.usage\"}, machine)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Comment lire ce tableau",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "La fenêtre par défaut est **la semaine de quota en cours** — du jeudi 00:00 à maintenant. La colonne « semaine -1 » applique `offset 7d` à **la même fenêtre** : on compare donc le même nombre d'heures écoulées depuis jeudi, pas une semaine partielle à une semaine complète.\n\n**Un écart négatif est une baisse de consommation.** Un panneau vide signifie qu'il n'y a pas de donnée pour la semaine comparée — c'est le cas tant que la collecte n'a pas un mois."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache relu — en cours",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "super-light-blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.token.usage\", type=\"cacheRead\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache relu — semaine -1",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.token.usage\", type=\"cacheRead\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range] offset 7d))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Écart",
      "description": "Négatif = on consomme moins que la semaine dernière au même moment.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "100 * (sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.token.usage\", type=\"cacheRead\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range])) / sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.token.usage\", type=\"cacheRead\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range] offset 7d)) - 1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Coût relatif — en cours",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.cost.usage\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Coût relatif — semaine -1",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=\"claude_code.cost.usage\", machine=~\"$machine\"}[$__range] offset 7d))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
